  tag: 0
  question: "Nh\xE0 s\xE0n tr\xEAn hoa v\u0103n tr\u1ED1ng \u0111\u1ED3ng g\u1EAFn
    v\u1EDBi c\u01B0 d\xE2n n\xE0o?"
  options:
